## Third-party data: LongMemEval (R13 confirmatory run)

The R13 confirmatory run uses an 8-question subset of LongMemEval
(https://github.com/xiaowu0162/LongMemEval; dataset xiaowu0162/longmemeval,
split longmemeval_s). The questions are in
`lce_validation/fixtures/bench_users/lme/questions_lme.json` and
`lce_validation/data/lme_subset.json`; claims digested from its sessions are in
`results/bench_r13_confirm/wikis_cache/lme__*`. The session texts themselves
are not versioned: `python -m lce_validation.build_lme_subset` rebuilds them
from the source file, verified by SHA-256. LongMemEval is distributed under
